{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "G13.3 M-b(M168) TSR device measured entry evidence",
  "description": "evidence/g13_m_b_calibration_<slug>_<UTC>.json 与 evidence/g13_m_b_bench_<tier>_<UTC>.json。G13.3 M-b 标定/bench 腿逐条目 measured 面(标定程序 ci/g13_tsr_device_kernel_smoke.py 产,标定腿两跑位级一致,禁手写 P-09;results.trimmed_mean 供 budget_eval 通用路判读)。确定性面(device vs host 逐帧对拍容差 p100 + 三档 SSIM deficit)threshold = measured × 2.0(协议冻结 k,方向 max);帧时面(三档逐帧全链路 host Instant 墙钟,50×3 trimmed mean M141/M165 冻结统计口径)阈 = 实测 ×1.5 回归守护——不构成帧率对标通过线(正式帧率对标锚定 G14)。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "entry_id",
    "results",
    "protocol",
    "sample_manifest",
    "provenance",
    "timestamp"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "type": "string",
      "const": "rurix.g13tsrdevice.measured_entry.v1"
    },
    "entry_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^g13\\.tsr_device\\."
    },
    "results": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["trimmed_mean"],
      "properties": {
        "trimmed_mean": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      }
    },
    "protocol": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "sample_manifest": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["count", "digest"],
      "properties": {
        "count": { "type": "integer" },
        "digest": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "provenance": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["gpu", "backend", "base_commit"],
      "properties": {
        "gpu": { "type": "string" },
        "backend": { "type": "string" },
        "base_commit": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "cells": {
      "type": "object"
    },
    "stats": {
      "type": "object"
    },
    "timestamp": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}
